# sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_integration_pattern (Data Source)

Returns the Id of an integration pattern of SAP's Integration Solution Advisory Methodology and the
Ids of the domain and the style it combines. SAP describes integration patterns as the
combination of an integration domain and an integration style from which integration guidelines
are derived. The Ids differ between tenants, the names do not.

**Status:** supported. SAP's Entities API specification on the Business Accelerator Hub
documents this entity, and its requests were verified on a tenant. No opt-in switch is needed.

Names are compared exactly, including case. The plan fails when no entry or more than one entry
has the name.

